Subject: [PATCH 299/638] cef: apply upstream Viz OSR hooks

Apply CEF's Viz off-screen-rendering patch as its own prerequisite. It exposes host display and layered updater hooks used by the CEF OSR implementation.

AI_PHASE: chromium-cef-bootstrap

AI_STATUS: upstream-viz-osr-prerequisite-applied

AI_ASSUMPTION: CEF 52dac911 patch files are authoritative for Chromium 124.0.6367.0 integration

AI_VALIDATION: patch_updater.py --reapply --patch=viz_osr_2575 completed without rejects

AI_EVIDENCE: test-artifacts/-cef-bootstrap-20260724/10-libcef-static-focused.log

AI_DECISION_CHAIN:; 52dac911; 32c94ff29b
